      solarized's emphasized grey), not the terminal's bold default,
      which some terminals drew too dark
    * complete/ is now completion/, as std's completion plugin: the
      plugins are extra/completion/bio, ... (were extra/complete/bio);
      config.toml needs the new names (extra.completion.all = "*")
